{"seq":3,"slug":"rollout-incident-response-audit","title":"灰度上线、DNSSEC 故障应急与合规审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dnssec-chain-signing-validation-resolver/deployment-monitoring-rollout/rollout-incident-response-audit","wordCount":2940,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"灰度上线-dnssec-故障应急与合规审计\">灰度上线、DNSSEC 故障应急与合规审计</h1><p>DNSSEC 最危险的时段不是&quot;启用签名&quot;那一天，而是签名生效后的头一到两周——权威侧已签名、父区 DS 已发布，但全球递归解析器缓存里还并存着旧 DNSKEY 与新 DS 的各种组合，任何时序错误都会把区带从&quot;可解析&quot;变成&quot;Bogus&quot;，客户端只看到一个裸 SERVFAIL。灰度上线的意义，就是把失败限制在可观测、可回滚、可举证的范围内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>工程上把这件事拆成三个互相咬合的环节：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>灰度放量</strong>：先让验证逻辑以&quot;只观测不拦截&quot;的影子模式跑起来攒基线，再逐级把 Bogus 从&quot;记录&quot;升级为&quot;拒绝&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>故障应急</strong>：Bogus 一旦成立，在<strong>前向修复</strong>（补齐 DNSKEY / 重签 / 改 DS）与<strong>回滚</strong>（撤销签名、移除 DS）之间选，依据是失败爆炸半径与恢复所需的最大传播时延。</li>\n<li><strong>合规审计</strong>：把&quot;密钥怎么生成、DS 怎么提交、故障怎么处置&quot;固化成可复核的证据链。审计问的不是&quot;你有没有开 DNSSEC&quot;，而是&quot;你能否证明每次状态变更都按既定策略执行&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者共享同一时间基准。设某次变更的<strong>安全传播滞后</strong>为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{safe} = TTL_{DNSKEY} + TTL_{DS} + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖权威侧主从同步与解析器负缓存的抖动；任何早于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{safe}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的&quot;已恢复&quot;判断都是自欺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分阶段灰度-影子校验-放量-强制验证\">分阶段灰度：影子校验 → 放量 → 强制验证</h2><p>**影子校验（shadow validation）**是灰度的第一级，也最容易被跳过。做法是让一台（或一组）解析器完整执行校验流水线，但结果只写日志、不改变返回：答案照常返回，AD 位照常不置，Bogus 照常放过。它在零用户影响下回答三个问题——AD 命中率基线、Bogus 的 EDE 分布、失败集中在哪一级名字；这些信号由流水线哪些阶段产生，见同 hub 的<a href=\"../resolver-validation-recursive/validation-pipeline-negative-caching-ede\">校验流水线、负缓存策略与 EDE 诊断码</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>放量</strong>是把&quot;记录&quot;升级为&quot;拦截&quot;，按解析器组或域名子集分批。关键设计是<strong>放量单元要可独立回滚</strong>：一次覆盖全部解析器就不是灰度，而是全量上线加观察。放量期间必须同时盯两组指标——放量组自身的 Bogus 率，与未放量组的 AD 命中率；后者上升说明你把本来能被容忍的失败变成了拒绝。</p>\n<p><strong>强制验证</strong>是终点但仍不是&quot;设置完就走&quot;——算法可能因 RFC 8624 的状态调整而需要迁移，父区 DS 的 TTL 可能比预期长。下表把三级放量的准入条件写成可执行判据；观测窗口要&quot;覆盖一次完整重签周期&quot;，是因为签名有 inception/expiration 窗口，重签失败只在窗口边界暴露（时序见 <a href=\"../zone-signing-key-ops/ksk-zsk-csk-key-hierarchy\">KSK/ZSK/CSK 密钥分层与签名职责模型</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>观测窗口</th>\n<th>推进条件</th>\n<th>失败动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>影子校验</td>\n<td>AD 命中率、EDE 分类计数</td>\n<td>≥ 7 天，覆盖一次完整重签周期</td>\n<td>AD 率稳定且 EDE 无 7/8/9 聚集</td>\n<td>修信任锚或 NSEC3 参数后重跑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小流量放量</td>\n<td>放量组 Bogus 率、未放量组 AD 率</td>\n<td>≥ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\,\\Delta_{safe}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Bogus 率低于门限且未放量组无阶跃</td>\n<td>撤销该组强制验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全区带强制</td>\n<td>SERVFAIL 总量、按 EDE 分解的失败</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n<td>无区带级 EDE 6/9 聚类</td>\n<td>触发分级应急（下节）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"上线检查点与放量门控\">上线检查点与放量门控</h2><p>检查点要能在<strong>权威侧本地</strong>完成，不依赖全网观测；放量门控才依赖全网观测——混为一张清单会让&quot;等全网数据&quot;拖慢本地修复。三条最常被忽略：</p>\n<p><strong>安全跛脚（security lameness）。</strong> 父区存在 DS、子区 DNSKEY RRset 里却没有匹配密钥，区带即为 Bogus（RFC 6781 §4.3.3）——KSK 轮换时&quot;先撤旧 KSK 再提交新 DS&quot;就会制造它。检查方法是本地用父区 DS 摘要比对子区 DNSKEY，见 <a href=\"../dnssec-cryptographic-chain/dnssec-record-model-rrsig-dnskey-ds\">DS/DNSKEY 记录模型与 RRSIG 覆盖范围</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>算法与摘要合规预检。</strong> RFC 8624 的现行状态：签名侧 <code>ECDSAP256SHA256</code>(13)/<code>RSASHA256</code>(8) 为 MUST、<code>ED25519</code>(15) 为 RECOMMENDED、<code>RSASHA1</code>(5)/<code>RSASHA1-NSEC3-SHA1</code>(7)/<code>RSASHA512</code>(10) 为 NOT RECOMMENDED、<code>RSAMD5</code>(1)/<code>DSA</code>(3)/<code>ECC-GOST</code>(12) 为 MUST NOT；DS 摘要侧 <code>SHA-256</code>(2) 为 MUST、<code>SHA-1</code>(1) 为 MUST NOT。预检要回答本区带签了哪些算法、父区存了哪些摘要、验证器支持哪些——取交集。另两条本地硬判据：距 expiration 余量大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 重签间隔；NSEC3 迭代次数在验证器容忍范围内。</p>\n<p><strong>放量的爆炸半径。</strong> 若某解析器组承载全网 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 比例流量、组内 Bogus 率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，该次放量引入的用户可见失败量级约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F \\approx w \\cdot b \\cdot Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 小的组可容忍更高的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障应急-ede-驱动的分级响应\">故障应急：EDE 驱动的分级响应</h2><p>应急第一原则是<strong>先分级、再动作</strong>：同样是 SERVFAIL，EDE 6（DNSSEC Bogus）与 EDE 5（网络不可达）处置完全不同，混入同一告警通道会让值班人员在网络抖动时误触发密钥回滚。分级以 EDE 码与失败名字扇出为轴：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>L1 局部</strong>：单一名字或单一签名者聚集的 EDE 7/8/9，扇出有限，优先前向修复（重签、补 DNSKEY），不动全局信任锚。</li>\n<li><strong>L2 区带级 Bogus</strong>：整个区带大面积失败，通常是 DS/DNSKEY 失配或密钥丢失。ZSK 类可<strong>立即重签</strong>（快）；KSK 类须按 RFC 6781 §4.2 应急轮换流程走，涉及父区 DS 更新，需跨组织协调。</li>\n<li><strong>L3 信任锚级</strong>：解析器信任锚与父区 DS 双双失配，或根/TLD 级变更超出预期——最接近&quot;关闭 DNSSEC&quot;的状态，属明确取舍而非首选。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>应急 KSK 轮换有两条路线，选错会主动制造 Bogus。RFC 6781 §4.2.1.1 的<strong>保信任</strong>路线：新旧 KSK 并存、降低 DNSKEY TTL、以短有效期重签、提交新 DS、等父区发布且旧 DS TTL 过期后再撤旧 KSK；同时必须用<strong>带外认证通道</strong>通知父区，否则攻击者可用已泄露密钥伪造轮换请求。§4.2.1.2 的<strong>破信任</strong>路线（先换子区 KSK 再改 DS）会让区带在修复完成前一直是 Bogus，只在极端情况使用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[告警: SERVFAIL 上升] --&gt; B[读 EDE 码与失败名字扇出]&#10;  B --&gt; C{EDE 5 网络类?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| N[按网络故障处理]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D{扇出范围}&#10;  D --&gt;|单名字/单签名者| E[L1: 重签或补 DNSKEY]&#10;  D --&gt;|整个区带| F{密钥类型}&#10;  F --&gt;|ZSK| G[立即重签]&#10;  F --&gt;|KSK| H[RFC 6781 4.2.1 应急轮换&lt;br/&gt;带外通道通知父区]&#10;  D --&gt;|信任锚级| I[L3: CDS 0 0 0 0 移除 DS]&#10;  E --&gt; J[等负缓存窗口后判恢复]&#10;  G --&gt; J&#10;  H --&gt; K[等 Delta_safe 后判恢复]&#10;  I --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n  A[告警: SERVFAIL 上升] --&gt; B[读 EDE 码与失败名字扇出]\n  B --&gt; C{EDE 5 网络类?}\n  C --&gt;|是| N[按网络故障处理]\n  C --&gt;|否| D{扇出范围}\n  D --&gt;|单名字/单签名者| E[L1: 重签或补 DNSKEY]\n  D --&gt;|整个区带| F{密钥类型}\n  F --&gt;|ZSK| G[立即重签]\n  F --&gt;|KSK| H[RFC 6781 4.2.1 应急轮换&lt;br/&gt;带外通道通知父区]\n  D --&gt;|信任锚级| I[L3: CDS 0 0 0 0 移除 DS]\n  E --&gt; J[等负缓存窗口后判恢复]\n  G --&gt; J\n  H --&gt; K[等 Delta_safe 后判恢复]\n  I --&gt; K</pre><p><strong>&quot;修复完成&quot;不等于&quot;恢复&quot;。</strong> RFC 9520 要求解析器缓存 DNSSEC 验证失败，TTL 在 1 秒到 5 分钟之间，且对持续失败使用起始 5 秒、上限 5 分钟的退避。权威侧修好后，最长 5 分钟内解析器仍返回缓存的失败结论；正确判据是在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>min</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(5\\text{min}, \\Delta_{safe})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 之后采样 EDE 分布。</p>\n<p><strong>最后手段的代价要写在预案里。</strong> RFC 8078 规定子区可用带签名的 <code>CDS 0 0 0 0</code>（或 <code>CDNSKEY 0 3 0 0</code>）通知父区删除整条 DS RRset，算法 0 专为该信号保留。这会把区带降为 Insecure——<strong>暂时暴露于缓存投毒与欺骗</strong>，RFC 8078 称其为最后手段，并强调无签名的中间状态仍优于持续的验证失败。</p>\n<p>最后还有一类故障不属于密码学却被误判为 DNSSEC：<strong>&quot;无法通信&quot;型服务器</strong>。RFC 8906（BCP 231）指出，不响应合法查询与丢包在客户端看来无法区分，会诱发重试、EDNS 回退与验证失败；排障探针因此必须<strong>从防火墙外发起</strong>，把权威、中间盒、负载均衡与清洗设备当成一个系统来测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规审计-把操作固化成可复核证据\">合规审计：把操作固化成可复核证据</h2><p>审计不评价架构是否优雅，只核对三件事：<strong>策略是否事先写定、执行是否留下痕迹、异常是否被记录并闭环</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>策略类。</strong> RFC 6841 提供 DNSSEC 政策与实践声明（DPS）框架；可审计的 DPS 至少固定密钥算法与长度、KSK/ZSK 职责划分、各密钥生效周期、轮换与应急流程、授权人。RFC 6781 §3.3 的经验值是常做轮换时 KSK 一年、在线 ZSK 约一个月，生效周期下界应为若干倍的最大区带 TTL。</p>\n<p><strong>密钥生命周期类。</strong> 密钥生成、备份、销毁的过程记录，尤其离线签名与 HSM 的使用：RFC 6781 §3.4.3 建议长期密钥存放于离线、物理安全的系统，在线签名需强主机安全或 HSM；§3.4.4 要求使用经过评估的强随机数发生器。审计会追问 HSM 认证等级（如 FIPS 140-2/3）与 ceremony 见证记录，取证见<a href=\"../zone-signing-key-ops/key-ceremony-hsm-offline-signing\">密钥仪式、HSM 与离线签名工程</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>变更与委派类。</strong> 每次 DS 变更的提交凭证（EPP 回执、CDS 信号日志）、父区侧 TTL 等待记录、<code>Delta_safe</code> 核算。ICANN 的 gTLD 注册协议要求注册局支持 DNSSEC，根区与多数 TLD 支持 RFC 8078 的 CDS/CDNSKEY 自动同步，这些回执即&quot;DS 已更新&quot;的证据。</p>\n<p><strong>运行监控类。</strong> AD 命中率时序、按 EDE 码分解的失败计数、外部探测结果（RFC 8906 式探针）、每次事件的处置记录——把&quot;我们一直在监控&quot;变成&quot;这是事件发生时的快照&quot;。历史先例：2018 年 10 月 11 日根区 KSK 轮换（KSK-2017 取代 KSK-2010），IANA 提前发布信任锚分发计划并保留双签窗口。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据类别</th>\n<th>具体产物</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n<th>建议保留期</th>\n<th>它回答的审计问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>策略</td>\n<td>DPS（RFC 6841 框架）</td>\n<td>安全/架构</td>\n<td>长期，版本化</td>\n<td>变更前是否已有既定策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密钥生命周期</td>\n<td>ceremony 记录、HSM 认证、备份/销毁单</td>\n<td>密钥管理员</td>\n<td>≥ 密钥生命周期 + 1 年</td>\n<td>密钥是否按策略生成与保管</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>委派变更</td>\n<td>DS 提交回执、CDS 信号日志、TTL 等待记录</td>\n<td>DNS 运维</td>\n<td>≥ 2 个轮换周期</td>\n<td>DS 变更是否授权且可追溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行监控</td>\n<td>AD 率时序、EDE 分解计数、外部探针结果</td>\n<td>SRE/可观测</td>\n<td>≥ 1 年（滚动）</td>\n<td>故障是否被及时发现并闭环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件</td>\n<td>应急工单、回滚记录、恢复判据计算</td>\n<td>值班/事件经理</td>\n<td>≥ 1 年</td>\n<td>异常是否按预案处置并复盘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一个易漏维度是<strong>算法退役的合规性</strong>：RFC 8624 的算法状态随验证器生态变化，三年前合规的区带今天可能仍用 NOT RECOMMENDED 的算法签名。审计问题是&quot;你如何跟踪算法状态并计划迁移&quot;，而非&quot;当时的算法是否合规&quot;。迁移须按保守顺序推进——先加新算法签名、等旧签名从缓存过期、再加新 DNSKEY、等旧 DNSKEY 过期后才改父区 DS，最后撤旧材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>灰度不是&quot;慢慢来&quot;，而是把失败锁进可回滚的单元。</strong> 影子校验零影响攒基线、放量组可独立回滚、强制验证后仍持续观测，三级各有准入判据。</li>\n<li><strong>门控指标要有物理含义。</strong> 放量风险约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F \\approx w \\cdot b \\cdot Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，用爆炸半径而非固定百分比设门限；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{safe} = TTL_{DNSKEY} + TTL_{DS} + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"h