emantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>审计核对的是策略—执行—异常的闭环。</strong> 策略（RFC 6841 DPS）、密钥生命周期（RFC 6781 §3.4）、委派变更回执、运行监控与事件记录缺一即不可举证；DNSSEC 之外的&quot;无法通信&quot;型缺陷（RFC 8906）也要能被探针排除。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"灰度上线、DNSSEC 故障应急与合规审计","id":"灰度上线-dnssec-故障应急与合规审计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分阶段灰度：影子校验 → 放量 → 强制验证","id":"分阶段灰度-影子校验-放量-强制验证"},{"level":2,"text":"上线检查点与放量门控","id":"上线检查点与放量门控"},{"level":2,"text":"故障应急：EDE 驱动的分级响应","id":"故障应急-ede-驱动的分级响应"},{"level":2,"text":"合规审计：把操作固化成可复核证据","id":"合规审计-把操作固化成可复核证据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"验证率度量、监控指标与告警体系设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dnssec-chain-signing-validation-resolver/deployment-monitoring-rollout/validation-